OL,3,GNEWSAFunds needed to repair war
OL,4,Amemorial pavilion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pavilion situated on a historic
OL,7,Fcricket and football ground dating back
OL,8,Fto World War One is in need of urgent
OL,9,Frepairs.
OL,11,FThe War Memorial pavilion, which houses
OL,12,Fchanging rooms for the teams that play
OL,13,Fat Watchet War Memorial Ground, dates
OL,14,Fback to 1929 and is now in a state of
OL,15,Fdisrepair.
OL,17,FThe committee that looks after the
OL,18,Fpavilion plans to bid for money to
OL,19,Fcarry out repairs and improvements,
OL,20,Fhowever it is first fundraising for the
OL,21,Fdeposit of #15,000.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
