OL,3,GNEWSAFunds needed to repair war
OL,4,Amemorial pavilion
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartin Strong, club captain at Watchet
OL,7,FCricket Club, said the work was needed
OL,8,Fas the changing rooms are too small.
OL,9,F"It's a major asset to the town and if
OL,10,Fit's lost it could be lost for good,"
OL,11,Fhe added.
